# 行尾与二进制判定——SHA256SUMS.txt 是按字节算的，Windows 上 clone 若被转成 CRLF，
# 校验会全红、.sh 也可能被 bash 嫌 ^M；这里强制 LF，二进制明确不转换。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.so binary
*.so.1 binary
*.tar binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pt binary
*.safetensors binary
